Package: gnomecast
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ismeetxd <ismeetxd@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: gjs, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, libglib2.0-bin | glib-bin, jq, wl-clipboard, libnotify-bin, systemd
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-prefs
Homepage: https://github.com/ismeetxd/gnomecast
Description: Fast, keyboard-first Raycast-style launcher for GNOME
 Gnomecast is a clean-room Raycast-style launcher built natively for GNOME
 using GJS, GTK4, Libadwaita, and an optional flea-search Rust accelerator.
 Features include:
  - Instant Super+Space / Windows+Space hotkey toggle
  - Desktop apps and GNOME system settings search with frecency
  - Built-in Soulver-style calculator and currency converter
  - Action palette (Ctrl+K), arguments, and favorites
